scratch-pv/

# =============================================================================
# Installer / Distribution Packages
# =============================================================================
# Built installer packages are release artifacts, not source. They belong on
# GitHub Releases — which .github/workflows/build-and-release.yml already
# publishes to — and not in git, where every rebuild would store another
# multi-megabyte blob in history forever.
#
# `*.exe` and `*.zip` already appear elsewhere in this file and cover the
# Windows-installer and archive forms. The three rules below close the macOS
# installer / disk-image and Windows MSI gap rather than duplicating those.
#
# A wildcard rule over every plugin's `dist` folder was considered and
# DELIBERATELY REJECTED. Those folders also hold hand-authored source:
# O-Tremolo's Inno Setup script (`installer.iss`) and the install-readme text
# files for both O-Tremolo and O-Polystutter live in exactly such a folder. A
# directory-wide rule would silently stop new installer scripts from being
# tracked. Match on the built-artifact extension instead — do not broaden this
# to the containing directory.
*.pkg
*.dmg
*.msi
